{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u795e\u6bba\u3057\u306e\u84bc\u9280",
    "steam_appid": 2988490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/c661ed16f85cd0471ed210225d3b1e75.avif?t=1749491161\" width=650 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Silver Blade of Gods' End&quot; is basically a game in the tactical simulation RPG genre,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it's a regional control simulation RPG in which you win in battle mode, expand your own territory, and conquer enemy territory to advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/85502431db20fd4858337de1490f736d.avif?t=1749491161\" width=616 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe game starts with a tutorial, then cycles through battle mode and map mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192A system for progressing smoothly through each battle, as shown below</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Acquire character-specific skills by leveling up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Hire mercenary characters, purchase recovery items, and equipment items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Add military budget to gain various effects, such as increased number of actions and morale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192The Cave of Trials where you can level up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Walks where you can interact with characters and obtain items and skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Quests where you send out squads to receive rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Change game speed, volume, difficulty, etc. in settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/49f47ecd172248be187fd26c06e61c75.avif?t=1749491161\" width=616 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/8f04c91bf273f01dce70a0eb9e31b9af.avif?t=1749491161\" width=616 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your base, you can organize your fighting characters and shop at the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, events will occur on quests and during walks, allowing you to receive rewards and increase the number of your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/11e5b647e4b628966a3a45e2f698c890.avif?t=1749491161\" width=616 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In map mode, you have a limited number of actions that can be taken, and these will decrease as you advance or move your platoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to think carefully about what actions to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/35d3ce497f12bbef8288e2bcb40bfdf8.avif?t=1749491161\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you advance into enemy territory in map mode, you will enter battle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game branches into four scenarios in the middle, so each battle is short and the tempo is good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will win if you annihilate the enemy by using bonuses that come with specific characters, various skills, and job functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the stage, you may not only annihilate the enemy, but also be the first to seize treasure chests or escort villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/38c0f19c21628003e5026053a0f8ee5d.poster.avif?t=1749491161\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/38c0f19c21628003e5026053a0f8ee5d.webm?t=1749491161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/38c0f19c21628003e5026053a0f8ee5d.mp4?t=1749491161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system for progressing at a good pace: Part 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Combo System&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has its own compatibility, and if you attack an opponent whose weak spot you can exploit, you can act again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;WEAK&quot; mark is displayed on opponents whose weak spots you can exploit, making it easy to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/a1044ef42eea544f872a05832baae68f.poster.avif?t=1749491161\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/a1044ef42eea544f872a05832baae68f.webm?t=1749491161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/a1044ef42eea544f872a05832baae68f.mp4?t=1749491161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System for progressing at a good pace: Part 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Platoon system&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fighting, each player will form a platoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you combine a platoon with a specific character, a platoon bonus will occur!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, if you defeat the platoon leader, all characters belonging to that platoon will retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The character with a star mark is the platoon leader)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the platoon leader is strengthened with more HP, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you only aim for the platoon leader, you may be in danger of being surrounded by enemy platoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/92475a10c2a59dfbaa19b825dc48f88e.poster.avif?t=1749491161\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/92475a10c2a59dfbaa19b825dc48f88e.webm?t=1749491161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/92475a10c2a59dfbaa19b825dc48f88e.mp4?t=1749491161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System for progressing at a good pace: Part 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Turn Limit System&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number in the top center of the screen is the number of turns remaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of remaining turns will gradually decrease, and when it reaches 0, the side with the most power gauge at that point will win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The power gauge decreases when a character is defeated)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the power gauge is in a draw, your side will lose, so you cannot win by just running away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These systems can shorten the battle times in SRPGs, which tend to be long,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so you can progress through the game at a good pace, even if your level increases and your stats become high in the second half!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/e5da5b1da2780d7dba84476c8c22511c.avif?t=1749491161\" width=400 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, giant robot battles and giant statue battles will occur under special conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy battles with a different kind of tension than usual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/c661ed16f85cd0471ed210225d3b1e75.avif?t=1749491161\" width=650 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Silver Blade of Gods' End&quot; is basically a game in the tactical simulation RPG genre,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it's a regional control simulation RPG in which you win in battle mode, expand your own territory, and conquer enemy territory to advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/85502431db20fd4858337de1490f736d.avif?t=1749491161\" width=616 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe game starts with a tutorial, then cycles through battle mode and map mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192A system for progressing smoothly through each battle, as shown below</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Acquire character-specific skills by leveling up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Hire mercenary characters, purchase recovery items, and equipment items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Add military budget to gain various effects, such as increased number of actions and morale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192The Cave of Trials where you can level up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Walks where you can interact with characters and obtain items and skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Quests where you send out squads to receive rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u2192Change game speed, volume, difficulty, etc. in settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extr