aragraph\" >so you can progress through the game at a good pace, even if your level increases and your stats become high in the second half!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988490/extras/e5da5b1da2780d7dba84476c8c22511c.avif?t=1749491161\" width=400 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, giant robot battles and giant statue battles will occur under special conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy battles with a different kind of tension than usual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
